1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,085
The heart of a breeding programme is the cross.

2
00:00:03,085 --> 00:00:11,236
First, collect germplasm, the landraces and wild relatives, into a gene bank, and choose two parents.

3
00:00:11,236 --> 00:00:16,328
Then, on the female parent, remove the anthers before they shed pollen.

4
00:00:16,328 --> 00:00:17,968
That is emasculation.

